<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/HashAlgorithm/blake2b256> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "BLAKE2b algorithm with a digest size of 256, as defined in RFC 7693 <https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/rfc7693/> Section 4."@en .
_:Naf4d6f9234a44319ad500f0d9c93eeb3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
